# Environment variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `PORT` | `3000` | Server port |
| `HOST` | `0.0.0.0` | Server bind address |
| `JWT_SECRET` | dev default | **Must set in production** (startup fails otherwise) |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | Fastify log level |
| `CORS_ORIGIN` | disabled | Optional allowed CORS origin; same-origin production needs no setting |
| `NODE_ENV` | — | Set to `production` for prod mode |
| `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` | — | WebPush VAPID public key |
| `WEDDING_SECRETS_KEY` | — | AES-256-GCM key for integration credentials (required in Docker production) |
| `WEDDING_UPLOADS_PATH` | `server/uploads` | Persistent directory for uploaded images and documents |
| `WEDDING_DB_PATH` | `server/data/wedding.db` | SQLite database file location |
| `WEBHOOK_DELIVERY_RETENTION_DAYS` | `90` | Days to retain outbound webhook delivery history |
| `AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS` | unset (report-only) | **Off by default.** When set (e.g. `365`), a daily job deletes audit rows older than this many days. The platform posture is report-only until a venue explicitly enables this. |
| `TRUSTED_PROXIES` | unset (trust all) | Comma-separated proxy IPs/CIDRs to trust for `X-Forwarded-For`. Set when the app port is reachable directly (not only via the Caddy reverse proxy) so spoofed client IPs are ignored. |
| `BASE_URL` | — | Public app origin used for payment checkout return URLs |
| `TEST_DB` | — | `:memory:` for the vitest suite |
